@startuml
autonumber

title US205 - View Real-Time Aircraft Availability — Simplified Sequence Diagram
actor "Air Transport Company Collaborator (ATCC)" as ATCC
participant ":System" as Sys

ATCC -> Sys: Requests to view real-time aircraft availability status
Sys --> ATCC: Displays the real-time status of the aircraft fleet (e.g., active, in-flight, under maintenance)

@enduml